   254	
   255	    Rule:
   256	    - Both yellow anchors stay where they are and seed two disconnected assemblies.
   257	    - Non-anchor sprites are grouped by body color; each color batch can connect only to the anchor family encoded by that color.
   258	    - First-layer colors attach to pre-existing anchor ports, then second-layer colors attach to the new frontier created by the earlier batch of the same family. Red connectors must finish in exact pairs.
